Native builds compile in two C libraries for local mail storage: SQLite (public domain; through the
rusqlite and libsqlite3-sys crates, MIT) and Zstandard (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc.
and affiliates; through the zstd, zstd-safe and zstd-sys crates, BSD-3-Clause). The browser build
includes neither. Their licence texts are reproduced in full at the end of this file.

